OL,3,AAdjusting triple lock to fund social
OL,4,Acare 'is about helping pensioners',
OL,5,ABurnham says, as Tories criticise plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn his conference speech on Tuesday,
OL,8,FBurnham said, from April 2030, the
OL,9,Fannual earnings link will be dropped -
OL,10,Fhere's what he said in full
OL,12,FThe Conservatives have criticised the
OL,13,Fproposal, with Tory chair Kevin
OL,14,FHollinrake saying it amounts to "taking
OL,15,Fmoney out of the pocket of pensioners
OL,16,Fand using it elsewhere in the system"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
