OL,6,
OL,7,FAlso in his interview with the Today
OL,8,Fprogramme, Burnham says there are
OL,9,F"clearly options to be considered" when
OL,10,Fit comes to the UK rejoining the EU -
OL,11,Fbut the government has to look at
OL,12,F"what's doable"
